      "text": "@YH62284741 What do you mean by completely new industry? \n\nI’ve liked space companies like $RKLB since 2024 and well aware there’s a gap that needs to be bridged. \n\nBut my opinion is that Rocketlab does build into what SpaceX is today, and there’s room for others in the final frontier.",
