      "text": "You’re good at industry chain research, so I wouldn’t recommend you comment too early when stepping into a completely new industry. \nWhether it’s ASTS or RKLB, their competitive situation against SpaceX is much more severe than the competition between leading players and others within the semiconductor industry.",
